realm not the dark territory
As for intruding here,

11
00:00:57,220 --> 00:00:59,500
I guess we are. Technically.

12
00:01:03,060 --> 00:01:07,280
Well, Nell, do these two look
anything like monsters to you? Huh?

13
00:01:08,060 --> 00:01:09,942
Where are their horns and tails?

14
00:01:10,180 --> 00:01:11,740
But how should I know?

15
00:01:11,900 --> 00:01:14,497
I was just telling you what
the books said they look like.

16
00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:17,168
You're the one jumping
to conclusions, Seal.

17
00:01:19,100 --> 00:01:20,440
Ladies? We'll go.

18
00:01:20,740 --> 00:01:23,211
If someone sees us, you'll get in trouble.

19
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:31,220
Don't worry, there's no
chance of that happening.

20
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:33,637
This morning, the church
ordered all the monks,

21
00:01:33,720 --> 00:01:37,197
nuns, and apprentices to stay in
their quarters and lock their doors.

22
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:40,177
This was the perfect
opportunity for us to sneak

23
00:01:40,260 --> 00:01:42,907
out and have a look at
these nasty intruders.

24
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:49,040
They're human.

25
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:50,520
Yes, very.

26
00:01:52,540 --> 00:01:56,277
We heard you were arrested, but broke
your spiritual chains and escaped.

27
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:59,617
We also heard you defeated
two Integrity Knights!

28
00:01:59,700 --> 00:02:02,677
That's why I was sure you were
monsters from the Dark Territory.

29
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:04,637
Either that or Knights of Darkness.

30
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:08,560
I'm sure you can understand why
we were so curious about you.

31
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:13,657
One last thing?

32
00:02:13,740 --> 00:02:16,269
Do you mind telling us
what your names are?

33
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:21,460
Not at all. I'm Eugeo.

34
00:02:21,620 --> 00:02:23,320
And this here is Kirito.

35
00:02:25,140 --> 00:02:26,900
Do you not have last names?

36
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:29,030
No.

37
00:02:29,113 --> 00:02:30,257
My family are settlers.

38
00:02:30,340 --> 00:02:33,440
And do you have last names? Yes.

39
00:02:33,820 --> 00:02:36,291
We've been waiting to share them with you.

40
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:47,720
My full name, Sinner, is Lino Synthesis.

41
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:49,237
I open the eyes of the eyes.

42
00:03:49,320 --> 00:03:52,217
I open the eyes of my eyes.

43
00:03:52,300 --> 00:03:54,457
I'm with my eyes.

44
00:03:54,540 --> 00:03:56,240
I'm going to connect you.

45
00:03:59,180 --> 00:04:00,886
I'm going to hear your voice.

46
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:06,520
I'm going to fight you.

47
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:11,120
I'm going to go myself.

48
00:04:30,580 --> 00:04:31,980
Yuxia!

49
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,320
Yuxia!

50
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:40,900
Heh, my name is Beezel Synthesis 29.

51
00:04:41,860 --> 00:04:43,940
You're... Pfft!

52
00:04:45,180 --> 00:04:46,010
In...

53
00:04:46,093 --> 00:04:46,923
Te...

54
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:56,560
Don't fret, Eugeo, without a last name.

55
00:04:56,940 --> 00:04:58,320
You're ours now.

56
00:05:05,080 --> 00:05:07,060
It's a paralysis poison.

57
00:05:08,260 --> 00:05:09,857
We don't want you to die yet.

58
00:05:09,940 --> 00:05:12,646
Not until we get you to
the 50th floor anyway.

59
00:05:13,300 --> 00:05:15,220
I'm sure you must be wondering,

60
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:20,500
how in the world did these two little
girls become Integrity Knights?

61
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:27,060
We were born and raised
inside the Central Cathedral.

62
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:33,980
One day, Administrator herself ordered
the monks and nuns here to create us.

63
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:38,377
She needed test subjects
for a sacred arch she was

64
00:05:38,460 --> 00:05:41,342
experimenting with that
could resurrect the dead.

65
00:05:43,260 --> 00:05:47,495
We received our callings when we were
five, earlier than other children.

66
00:05:47,880 --> 00:05:50,080
Our job was to kill each other.

67
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:54,141
We were given little swords
that looked like toys.

68
00:05:54,260 --> 00:05:57,436
Then we'd peer off and take
turns stabbing each other.

69
00:06:28,700 --> 00:06:30,560
At first, administrators'

70
00:06:30,940 --> 00:06:35,020
attempts at resurrection were,
how shall I say, not so good.

71
00:06:35,960 --> 00:06:38,280
There were some children who exploded,

72
00:06:38,580 --> 00:06:42,720
and others who ended up
as weird blobs of flesh.

73
00:06:43,260 --> 00:06:45,657
And still others who returned, but were...

74
00:06:45,740 --> 00:06:46,580
different.

75
00:06:47,320 --> 00:06:51,673
We were being resurrected over and
over, but we didn't like dying in pain.

76
00:06:51,880 --> 00:06:54,957
So the two of us researched
how to kill with one strike.

77
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:58,317
We found that if we killed
cleanly, it didn't hurt as much.

78
00:06:58,400 --> 00:07:01,871
And the odds of being successfully
resurrected were higher.

79
00:07:03,220 --> 00:07:04,050
But...

80
00:07:04,133 --> 00:07:07,380
The problem was deciding
which strike worked the best.

81
00:07:08,740 --> 00:07:12,975
We narrowed it down to lopping up the
head or a quick stab to the heart.

82
00:07:13,260 --> 00:07:15,040
They both worked equally well.

83
00:07:17,640 --> 00:07:18,800
In the end, though,

84
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:23,557
Administrator decided it was too difficult
to master the Sacred Art of Resurrection.

85
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:27,405
We were about eight years old
when she abandoned the experiment.

86
00:07:27,980 --> 00:07:30,392
When it started, there were thirty of us.

87
00:07:30,660 --> 00:07:33,060
But Seal and I were the only survivors.

88
00:07:38,100 --> 00:07:41,857
Then, Administrator made a special
exception and made us Integrity Knights.

89
00:07:41,940 --> 00:07:44,060
Well, to a certain degree.

90
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:48,877
She said we hadn't learned enough to go
on guard duty like the other knights,

91
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:51,857
so we've been studying
the laws and sacred arts

92
00:07:51,940 --> 00:07:54,881
with the other apprentices
for the past two years.

93
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:57,720
To be honest, we're tired of it.

94
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,080
Earlier today,

95
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:04,737
we were discussing ways to earn our
dragons and divine objects more quickly.

96
00:08:04,820 --> 00:08:09,291
We heard that minions from the Dark
Territory had infiltrated the Cathedral.

97
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:14,557
So we thought, if we could capture and
execute them before the other knights could,

98
00:08:14,640 --> 00:08:17,117
it would show Administrator
how capable we were,

99
00:08:17,200 --> 00:08:19,177
and she would make us
full-bledged knights.

100
00:08:19,260 --> 00:08:20,907
So, we waited on the stairs.

101
00:08:23,520 --> 00:08:26,360
We're truly sorry for using poison on you.

102
00:08:26,860 --> 00:08:28,620
It was our only option.

103
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:33,000
You see, we wanted to bring you to
the 50th floor alive if possible.

104
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:36,537
Oh, and when we do get
there, don't you worry.

105
00:08:36,620 --> 00:08:38,973
Fiesel and I are really good at killing.

106
00:08:39,280 --> 00:08:40,860
It won't hurt at all!

107
00:08:57,180 --> 00:09:00,700
Well, well, if it isn't all
four of the Whirling Blades.

108
00:09:01,380 --> 00:09:04,777
As well as Vice Commander
Fanatio Synthesis 2!

109
00:09:04,860 --> 00:09:07,800
The whole Senate must be in a panic.

110
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:12,256
Why else would they ask you here,
fanatio of the heaven-piercing blade?

111
00:09:12,860 --> 00:09:17,500
You apprentices should not be on the
battlefield with honorable knights.

112
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:20,040
Now that is funny.

113
00:09:20,340 --> 00:09:23,317
It's because you bring honor
and tradition into battle

114
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:26,277
that you so-called mighty
integrity knights lost.

115
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:27,940
Not once, but twice.

116
00:09:28,620 --> 00:09:29,920
But don't you worry.

117
00:09:30,100 --> 00:09:32,557
As you can see, we caught the intruders.

118
00:09:32,640 --> 00:09:36,797
And we'll make sure the reputation of
the knights won't be sullied any further.

119
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:39,500
You can count on that. She's right.

120
00:09:39,740 --> 00:09:42,837
We're going to decapitate these
sinners right here and now.

121
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:47,273
So watch closely and make sure to give
an accurate report to the Pontifex.

122
00:09:48,220 --> 00:09:50,760
You are honorable knights, after all.

123
00:09:50,940 --> 00:09:53,097
We trust you not to steal our credit.

124
00:09:53,180 --> 00:09:54,800
That would be cowardly.

125
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:03,900
No bear!

126
00:10:04,380 --> 00:10:06,180
I can't...

127
00:10:27,420 --> 00:10:29,008
It'll wear off in a minute.

128
00:10:29,880 --> 00:10:32,233
As soon as you can move your lips again.

129
00:10:32,640 --> 00:10:34,317
Recite your perfect weapon art.

130
00:10:34,400 --> 00:10:35,400
But keep it down.

131
00:10:35,560 --> 00:10:37,417
This ain't gonna work if the night's here.

132
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:40,120
When it's ready to go,
hang on to it a bit.

133
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:41,500
Wait for my signal.

134
00:10:46,980 --> 00:10:50,620
I'm sure you're wondering,
how in the world can I move?

135
00:10:53,060 --> 00:10:54,780
You gave yourselves away.

136
00:10:55,520 --> 00:11:00,344
You said all the monks, nuns, and apprentices
were ordered to stay in their rooms.

137
00:11:00,560 --> 00:11:02,972
And if you're a monk, nun, or apprentice,

138
00:11:03,100 --> 00:11:05,924
there's no way you'd
disobey the church's order.

139
00:11:06,460 --> 00:11:07,957
But you weren't in your rooms.

140
00:11:08,040 --> 00:11:09,257
You were looking for us.

141
00:11:09,340 --> 00:11:12,164
So that meant you guys
weren't real apprentices.

142
00:11:14,060 --> 00:11:17,417
I also noticed those scabbards
you got are made of ruby oak.

143
00:11:17,500 --> 00:11:21,140
They use that wood to hold swords
made of toxic rubryl steel.

144
00:11:21,700 --> 00:11:22,530
Why?

145
00:11:22,613 --> 00:11:25,677
Because it's the only thing that
won't rot against the blade.

146
00:11:25,760 --> 00:11:30,157
There's no way you'd have something like
that if you were sisters in training.

147
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:34,900
That's why I started reciting a
poison-neutralizing art before you got near us.

148
00:11:35,660 --> 00:11:38,484
It took a while to kick
in, but what can you do?

149
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:42,776
There's more to strength
than being fast with a sword.

150
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:57,180
Don't worry, I won't kill you.

151
00:11:57,500 --> 00:11:59,560
I'm gonna teach you a lesson today.

152
00:12:00,220 --> 00:12:02,297
You're going to watch
these knights you made fun

153
00:12:02,380 --> 00:12:05,204
of fight and see what
real strength's all about.

154
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:17,609
Sorry for the wait,
Vice Commander Fanatio.

155
00:12:22,780 --> 00:12:25,560
My name's Kirito, the swordsman!

156
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:47,920
How dare you do battle
with a Vice Commander?

157
00:12:48,340 --> 00:12:50,957
The Four Whirling Blades
are your opponents here.

158
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:52,320
Turn and face us.

159
00:12:53,220 --> 00:12:54,560
Hold your position.

160
00:12:55,020 --> 00:12:57,380
This one is mine.

161
00:12:57,940 --> 00:12:59,040
As you wish.

162
00:13:05,180 --> 00:13:06,960
System call.

163
00:13:07,820 --> 00:13:09,780
Enhanced armament!

164
00:13:51,800 --> 00:13:54,360
My voice.

165
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:56,160
It's back.

166
00:13:57,820 --> 00:13:58,860
System call.

167
00:14:07,920 --> 00:14:13,540
Criminal or no, if you lived in Senator,
you should know what a mirror is.

168
00:14:15,820 --> 00:14:21,220
It is an instrument capable of
reflecting Solas' light completely.

169
00:14:22,420 --> 00:14:23,357
Long ago,

170
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:29,197
the Pontifex gathered 1,000 enormous
mirrors to focus Solas' midsummer light,

171
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:31,720
creating a pure white flame.

172
00:14:32,760 --> 00:14:37,460
It was so hot, it melted a
human-sized boulder within minutes.

173
00:14:38,780 --> 00:14:41,880
The pontifex, using her holy skills,

174
00:14:42,400 --> 00:14:45,060
fused the 1,000 mirrors together,

175
00:14:45,680 --> 00:14:48,880
then honed them to create
a magnificent sword.

176
00:14:55,180 --> 00:14:58,660
This sword, the Heaven-Piercing Blade,

177
00:14:59,280 --> 00:15:00,700
Know this,

178
00:15:00,980 --> 00:15:06,520
your stomach and foot were punctured by
the glorious power of the sun god Solus.

179
00:15:06,860 --> 00:15:09,560
It reflects the sun's energy.

180
00:15:12,560 --> 00:15:15,860
Now, sinner, prepare to meet your end.

181
00:15:17,880 --> 00:15:18,760
Destroy!

182
00:15:40,060 --> 00:15:42,600
Don't you dare look at me.

183
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:47,360
Your eyes are laced with disdain.

184
00:15:48,260 --> 00:15:49,720
Just like his.

185
00:15:50,820 --> 00:15:54,820
You men think my gender affects
the quality of my skill.

186
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:57,177
Even sinners deny me respect.

187
00:15:57,260 --> 00:15:59,860
I command you to fight me in earnest!

188
00:16:03,280 --> 00:16:04,800
I am a knight!

189
00:16:05,060 --> 00:16:06,560
An integrity knight!

190
00:16:11,820 --> 00:16:13,060
I get it.

191
00:16:13,240 --> 00:16:15,660
Your sword and skill, it's a cover.

192
00:16:16,020 --> 00:16:20,255
It'll let you step back and fire shots
and hide the fact you're a woman.

193
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:23,380
Ain't that right, Lady Fanatio?

194
00:16:24,520 --> 00:16:25,857
How dare you!

195
00:16:25,940 --> 00:16:31,237
Just so you know the reason I looked so
shocked before it wasn't cuz you're a

196
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:36,737
woman it's cuz when you lost your helmet
you lost all your nerve I know why you hide

197
00:16:36,820 --> 00:16:41,577
your face under that helmet if anyone
here's got a problem with you being a woman

198
00:16:41,660 --> 00:16:48,577
it's you you want to

199
00:16:48,660 --> 00:16:50,657
try go ahead I know

200
00:16:50,740 --> 00:16:53,157
what it's like to fight and lose to women,

201
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:54,257
and you know what?

202
00:16:54,340 --> 00:16:57,620
I never held back for
them, and I won't for you!

203
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:23,680
No way!

204
00:17:40,780 --> 00:17:42,000
I was wrong.

205
00:17:43,740 --> 00:17:45,080
You are different.

206
00:17:45,320 --> 00:17:47,080
Although you may be a sinner,

207
00:17:47,360 --> 00:17:50,654
you are quite unlike the other
men I have fought before.

208
00:17:51,400 --> 00:17:53,260
None of them had your spirit.

209
00:17:53,520 --> 00:17:57,820
Their attacks all lacked conviction
once they saw my detestable face.

210
00:17:58,860 --> 00:18:00,180
Detestable? Okay.

211
00:18:00,540 --> 00:18:04,857
Then, how come you comb your hair and
put on lipstick if you wear a helmet?

212
00:18:04,940 --> 00:18:07,646
You don't do it for
yourself, that's for sure.

213
00:18:15,560 --> 00:18:18,977
You're bitter because you can't have
the person you love and you know why?

214
00:18:19,060 --> 00:18:21,997
It's because the Church and
the Pontifex say you can't.

215
00:18:22,080 --> 00:18:26,080
Well, I'm here to destroy them and
free everyone from their tyranny!

216
00:18:26,640 --> 00:18:30,860
I can tell you are no agent of
darkness, as the Prime Minister claimed.

217
00:18:31,860 --> 00:18:34,566
Regardless, you are still
extremely dangerous.

218
00:18:34,900 --> 00:18:39,253
You would disrupt the Church and the
Knighthood, not just with your sword,

219
00:18:39,360 --> 00:18:40,640
but with your words.

220
00:18:41,700 --> 00:18:45,520
You also put the Human Empire
in peril, and that, sir,

221
00:18:45,780 --> 00:18:47,497
is a Knight's duty to protect.

222
00:18:47,580 --> 00:18:52,000
You speak the truth, but I
am obliged to defeat you!

223
00:18:52,840 --> 00:18:55,460
Even if it sullies my pride as a knight!

224
00:18:55,840 --> 00:19:00,680
Hidden light of the heaven-piercing
blade, cast off your shackles!

225
00:19:01,340 --> 00:19:03,100
Release recollection!

226
00:19:27,040 --> 00:19:28,620
You idiot!

227
00:19:30,440 --> 00:19:32,640
You're gonna kill us all!

228
00:19:35,440 --> 00:19:37,100
Now's my chance!

229
00:19:37,620 --> 00:19:39,180
My only chance!

230
00:19:40,780 --> 00:19:42,860
Enhance! Armament!

231
00:19:51,200 --> 00:19:52,720
Blue Rose! Bloom!

232
00:19:56,680 --> 00:19:57,840
Damn that rat!

233
00:20:09,280 --> 00:20:10,110
Kirito!

234
00:20:10,193 --> 00:20:13,400
Are you hurt? Don't move!
I'll heal you! I'm fine!

235
00:20:14,360 --> 00:20:16,280
Don't let up! Keep at it!

236
00:20:17,280 --> 00:20:18,220
She's tough.

237
00:20:19,680 --> 00:20:21,445
This ain't enough to stop her!

238
00:20:27,460 --> 00:20:29,200
System call!

239
00:20:39,360 --> 00:20:42,060
You knights, you're all the same!

240
00:20:42,480 --> 00:20:44,600
You're all heartless!

241
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:56,240
Stop fighting!

242
00:20:56,560 --> 00:20:58,040
Stop or die!

243
00:21:07,120 --> 00:21:08,640
It's no use.

244
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:10,080
I can't win.

245
00:21:11,040 --> 00:21:12,860
I can't beat her.

246
00:21:13,220 --> 00:21:15,691
You're letting hate get the better of you,

247
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:20,157
you, Eugeo. Stop it.

248
00:21:20,240 --> 00:21:24,064
You didn't come this far because
you hated the Integrity Knights,

249
00:21:25,300 --> 00:21:26,130
did you?

250
00:21:26,213 --> 00:21:27,937
You're here to get Alice back.

251
00:21:28,020 --> 00:21:29,961
You're here because you love her.

252
00:21:30,120 --> 00:21:31,040
But guess what?

253
